00:38:59.060 --> 00:39:07.300
Very interesting the situation here. You have three generations. You have Jacob generation, the old men,

00:39:07.300 --> 00:39:29.300
Joseph and Ephraim and Mashiach. Now, Jacob was born, raised in the old country. Joseph was the immigrant, who left home when he was a young man, and made it in America.

00:39:29.300 --> 00:39:31.180
came to America

00:39:31.180 --> 00:39:33.400
and

00:39:33.400 --> 00:39:36.120
