The chasm, the gap between the old and the young is so great that unless Joseph brings the New to them,

00:40:13.300 --> 00:40:17.300
Jacob cannot bless them. That is,

00:40:17.300 --> 00:40:24.300
and I, and you have to bring it to me if you want it to be like that

00:40:24.300 --> 00:40:33.300
so sometimes we the parents have to be the bridge between the grandparents and the grandchildren

00:40:33.300 --> 00:40:38.300
and we don't serve as this bridge between the generations

00:40:38.300 --> 00:40:48.300
whatever beauty the grandparents have will not be transferred to the children

00:40:48.300 --> 00:40:54.300
the children cannot reach the grandparents, the grandparents cannot reach the children

00:40:54.300 --> 00:41:13.860
again, I'm sorry if I will repeat again

