00:50:49.440 --> 00:50:52.440
My answer is very obvious for me, it's very simple.

00:50:52.440 --> 00:50:58.440
To bless, there is no greater blessing to an individual than to bless his children.

00:50:58.440 --> 00:51:00.260
any person

00:51:00.260 --> 00:51:02.560
