00:55:38.840 --> 00:55:42.840
it was always ha-marach, saving me from all the problems.

00:55:42.840 --> 00:55:46.840
So now, the understanding of G-d is this,

00:55:46.840 --> 00:55:48.840
from all the three ways,

00:55:48.840 --> 00:55:50.840
Yevarech et ha-me'arim

00:55:50.840 --> 00:55:52.840
He shall bless His children.

00:55:52.840 --> 00:55:55.840
In what way? Continuation.

00:55:55.840 --> 00:55:59.840
The most important thing for any living being

00:55:59.840 --> 00:56:02.840
is not to be the first and the last,

00:56:02.840 --> 00:56:06.840
but to be a part of an enterprise.

00:56:06.840 --> 00:56:08.840
We Jews are part of an enterprise.

00:56:08.840 --> 00:56:12.840
And that enterprise is our heart, our heart, our soul.

00:56:12.840 --> 00:56:16.840
And therefore the blessing for a Jewish boy and a Jewish woman

00:56:16.840 --> 00:56:21.840
is to be part of that chain, of that enterprise.

00:56:21.840 --> 00:56:22.840
And therefore it says,

00:56:22.840 --> 00:56:25.840
וְיִּקָּרֶבָהָם שְׁמִי וְשְׁבָהָם

00:56:25.840 --> 00:56:28.840
It should be my name, in the name of my parents,

00:56:28.840 --> 00:56:32.840
should be part of that chain of tradition.

00:56:32.840 --> 00:56:35.840
وَإِنْ هُوْ لَرَوْا

00:56:35.840 --> 00:56:37.840
