00:56:44.840 --> 00:56:47.840
in the midst of the earth.

00:56:47.840 --> 00:56:50.840
Now, what is the question?

00:56:50.840 --> 00:56:54.840
Fish don't multiply in the midst of the earth.

00:56:54.840 --> 00:56:56.840
Fish multiply where?

00:56:56.840 --> 00:57:08.180
But what does it say about the fish in the midst of the night?

00:57:09.240 --> 00:57:11.280
It's a beautiful, beautiful explanation.

00:57:12.540 --> 00:57:13.680
It refers to the galut.

00:57:15.300 --> 00:57:21.040
Because we all prosper when we are in our proper environment.

