You understand?

00:57:48.480 --> 00:58:02.480
even when we are outside our environment, we should be still many, just like we have this contradiction of many fish in the midst of the earth.

00:58:02.480 --> 00:58:12.480
In the same way, every Jew who is walking today in America or in South America or in Europe, and he puts on tefillin, he comes to Shabbat,

00:58:12.480 --> 00:58:16.480
it's like a fish multiplying outside the water, that's what he's saying.

00:58:16.480 --> 00:58:19.480
Alright, this is still, it's a beautiful, beautiful letter.

